WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.043
This month we have Chusok.

2
00:00:10.044 --> 00:00:16.360
It's a time to give thanks and remember our ancestors.

3
00:00:16.361 --> 00:00:19.750
Mom: Hana! Grandma bought you a gift.

4
00:00:19.751 --> 00:00:23.979
Hana: For me? But it's not my birthday.

5
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:28.171
Mom: I know. It's for Chusok.

6
00:00:28.172 --> 00:00:30.589
Bada: What about me, Mommy?

7
00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.665
Where's my present?

8
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:34.608
Mom: Here you are.

9
00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:38.901
Hana: Oh, Mommy! It's so pretty!

10
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:41.120
Mom: It's lovely, Hana!

11
00:00:41.121 --> 00:00:47.133
Mom: You can wear that when we go to Grandma's house at Chusok.

12
00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:51.161
Mom: Hana, can you help me carry this, please?

13
00:00:51.162 --> 00:00:55.062
Hana: But what if it gets on my dress?

14
00:00:55.063 --> 00:01:00.144
Mom: Don't be silly, Hana!

15
00:01:00.145 --> 00:01:02.219
Mom: Here, put this on.

16
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.688
Then your dress won't get dirty.

17
00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:07.046
Hana: It's dirty, Mom!

18
00:01:07.047 --> 00:01:09.737
My dress will get dirty too!

19
00:01:09.738 --> 00:01:13.563
Mom: Hana! Chusok is a day to give thanks.

20
00:01:13.564 --> 00:01:19.924
Mom: It's a day we help each other and show that we love each other.

21
00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:22.583
Mom: Now put this apron on!

22
00:01:22.584 --> 00:01:24.431
Bada: Oops!

23
00:01:24.432 --> 00:01:28.108
Hana: Oh, my dress! My dress!

24
00:01:28.109 --> 00:01:31.400
Look what you did, Bada!

25
00:01:31.401 --> 00:01:37.607
Mom: It's okay. We'll find something else for you to wear.

26
00:01:37.608 --> 00:01:39.361
Grandma: Here comes Hana.

27
00:01:39.362 --> 00:01:42.649
Come sit next to me, dear.

28
00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.456
Grandma: Chusok is a special day to give thanks.

29
00:01:46.457 --> 00:01:55.707
Grandma: It doesn't matter how we look or what we eat, [n3@as long as we are together as a family.

30
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:57.878
Grandma is right.

31
00:01:57.879 --> 00:02:01.409
Sometimes we forget to be thankful.

32
00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.023
I learned a valuable lesson.

33
00:02:04.024 --> 00:02:08.606
It's not important what we have but what we give.
